                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "okay, i did not consider that possibility. I thought it was a script one could just run without having to customize anything.\n\nAnyways i changed the reasoning in the commit message to be more about reducing the amount of tools and languages being used when a shell script can do the job as well."
                },
                {
                    "file": "scripts/crater",
                    "line": 26,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "Make these `local`."
                },
                {
                    "file": "scripts/crater",
                    "line": 26,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Done. Had to change it to a bash script, otherwise\n\n```\n    Running shellcheck (0.11.0)\n\nIn scripts/crater line 24:\n    local name=\"$1\"\n    ^--------^ SC3043 (warning): In POSIX sh, 'local' is undefined.\n\n\nIn scripts/crater line 25:\n    local repo_url=\"$2\"\n    ^------------^ SC3043 (warning): In POSIX sh, 'local' is undefined.\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "scripts/crater",
                    "line": 28,
                    "reviewer": {
